Title: Heard and McDonald Islands Management Zones

Authors:
  - URSULA HARRIS (INVESTIGATOR, TECHNICAL CONTACT)
  - ANGELA BENDER (DIF AUTHOR)

Owner: Commonwealth of Australia

Citation: Harris, U. (2007) Heard and McDonald Islands Management Zones, Ver. 1,  <em>Australian Antarctic Data Centre</em> - <a href="http://dx.doi.org/doi:10.26179/5b73a81686490">doi:10.26179/5b73a81686490</a>, Accessed: 2020-07-02

Revision Date: 2018-08-15

Metadata URL: https://data.aad.gov.au/metadata/records/heard_manage_gis

Dataset API URL: https://data.aad.gov.au/s3/api/bucket/datasets/gis/heard/Management_zones_py?export=json

Abstract: The Heard Island management zones are a polygon and line dataset stored in the Geographical Information System (GIS). These areas were developed inline with the Heard Island and McDonald Islands Marine Reserve Management Plan, published in 2005.

Use Constraints: This data set conforms to the CCBY Attribution License
(http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

Please follow instructions listed in the citation reference provided at http://data.aad.gov.au/aadc/metadata/citation.cfm?entry_id=heard_manage_gis when using these data.

